OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum petrol bomb reports a
OL,4,A'hoax', say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports of a museum being targeted with
OL,7,Fpetrol bombs, sparking a police
OL,8,Fresponse, turned out to be a hoax,
OL,9,Fofficers have said.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police (TVP) said six
OL,12,Ffire trucks, five police vehicles and
OL,13,FOxford security officers were sent to
OL,14,Fthe Oxford University Museum of Natural
OL,15,FHistory on Saturday night.
OL,17,FIn a post on social media, TVP Oxford
OL,18,Fsaid: "Thankfully, there was no threat
OL,19,Fto the museum, or the dinosaurs."
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
